"The format to save to. Options are:  - 'pickle' (default): creates a pickle "
"file with the data dictionary - 'matlab': creates a .mat file, for loading "
"in matlab - 'csv': creates a csv file (0D variables only) - 'json': creates "
"a json file"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pybamm/solvers/solution.py:docstring
#: of pybamm.solvers.solution.Solution.save_data:8
